sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant MainScreen
    participant ConfigScreen
    participant RunScreen
    participant ResultsScreen
    participant HelpPanel

    %% === 1. 预设场景选择流程 ===
    User->>MainScreen: ↑/↓ 选择预设
    MainScreen->>MainScreen: 高亮选中项
    User->>MainScreen: Enter 确认
    MainScreen->>MainScreen: _on_scenario_selected()
    MainScreen->>ConfigScreen: set_preset(config)
    MainScreen->>MainScreen: app.goto(ConfigScreen)
    ConfigScreen->>ConfigScreen: 自动填充参数
    ConfigScreen->>ConfigScreen: on_input_changed() 实时验证
    ConfigScreen-->>User: 显示验证状态 ✓/✗

    %% === 2. 配置验证流程 ===
    User->>ConfigScreen: 修改输入值
    ConfigScreen->>ConfigScreen: Input.Changed 事件
    ConfigScreen->>ConfigScreen: ValidatedInput.on_input_changed()
    alt 验证通过
        ConfigScreen->>ConfigScreen: 添加 .-valid 类
        ConfigScreen-->>User: 绿色边框 + ✓
    else 验证失败
        ConfigScreen->>ConfigScreen: 添加 .-invalid 类
        ConfigScreen-->>User: 红色边框 + 错误提示
    end

    %% === 3. 仿真运行流程 ===
    User->>ConfigScreen: 点击 "运行"
    ConfigScreen->>ConfigScreen: _validate_and_run()
    ConfigScreen->>RunScreen: set_config(cfg, do_plot)
    ConfigScreen->>RunScreen: app.goto(RunScreen)
    RunScreen->>RunScreen: on_mount() → run_simulation()
    
    RunScreen->>RunScreen: Phase: INIT
    RunScreen->>RunScreen: 初始化模型组件
    RunScreen-->>User: 显示 "初始化中..."
    
    RunScreen->>RunScreen: Phase: RUNNING
    loop 仿真循环
        RunScreen->>RunScreen: step 计算
        RunScreen->>RunScreen: 更新进度条
        RunScreen->>RunScreen: 更新统计卡片 (Speed/Torque/FPS)
        RunScreen-->>User: 实时进度反馈
    end
    
    RunScreen->>RunScreen: Phase: SAVING
    RunScreen->>RunScreen: 保存 HDF5 文件
    RunScreen-->>User: 显示 "保存中..."
    
    RunScreen->>RunScreen: Phase: COMPLETE
    RunScreen-->>User: 显示 "仿真完成!"

    %% === 4. 结果查看流程 ===
    User->>RunScreen: 点击 "查看结果"
    RunScreen->>ResultsScreen: set_results(data)
    RunScreen->>ResultsScreen: app.goto(ResultsScreen)
    ResultsScreen->>ResultsScreen: _show_results()
    ResultsScreen->>ResultsScreen: 更新 KPI 卡片
    ResultsScreen->>ResultsScreen: 渲染 SparkLine 趋势图
    ResultsScreen->>ResultsScreen: 填充 DataTable
    ResultsScreen-->>User: 展示完整结果

    %% === 5. 上下文帮助流程 ===
    User->>ConfigScreen: F1 帮助
    ConfigScreen->>HelpPanel: push_screen(HelpPanel("ConfigScreen"))
    HelpPanel->>HelpPanel: 加载帮助内容
    HelpPanel-->>User: 显示帮助面板
    User->>HelpPanel: Esc 关闭
    HelpPanel->>ConfigScreen: dismiss()
